<title>BELGIUM: EU raises distant high quality wheat import duty.</title>
<headline>EU raises distant high quality wheat import duty.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will on Tuesday raise duties on transatlantic imports of high quality soft wheat to 20.73 ecus a tonne, from 13.89 ecus, the European Commission said.</p>
<p>Duties on other cereal varieties remain unchanged.</p>
